    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.poster.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.webm?t=1733644404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.mp4?t=1733644404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Trams, Trains and Monorails</strong> is an engaging and strategic city-building game where you place hexagonal railway tiles to expand and develop a thriving metropolis. Immerse yourself in a vibrant 3D world where every decision shapes the future of your city. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/47a5470b508b44b60bea950873a407a2.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=130 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Expand your city through strategic placement of railway tiles<br></li><li> Watch the city and buildings evolve<br></li><li> Connect stations to level up the areas around them and unlock unique buildings<br></li><li> Develop Residential, Industrial, Commercial, and Arts Districts<br></li><li> Fulfill district-specific mini goals for extra points and additional tiles<br></li><li> Experiment with different layouts and connections to maximize your city\u2019s potential.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/262a35b0279c07365202a2059c63c182.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=262 /></span><br><br>Build, connect, and transform your city one tile at a time in <strong>Trams, Trains and Monorails</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a meticulous planner or a spontaneous builder, every tile placement brings a new challenge and endless possibilities. Dive into the captivating world of urban planning and transportation management today!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.poster.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.webm?t=1733644404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/9440f045424ed1280ef5770e4020dabf.mp4?t=1733644404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Trams, Trains and Monorails</strong> is an engaging and strategic city-building game where you place hexagonal railway tiles to expand and develop a thriving metropolis. Immerse yourself in a vibrant 3D world where every decision shapes the future of your city. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/47a5470b508b44b60bea950873a407a2.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=130 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Expand your city through strategic placement of railway tiles<br></li><li> Watch the city and buildings evolve<br></li><li> Connect stations to level up the areas around them and unlock unique buildings<br></li><li> Develop Residential, Industrial, Commercial, and Arts Districts<br></li><li> Fulfill district-specific mini goals for extra points and additional tiles<br></li><li> Experiment with different layouts and connections to maximize your city\u2019s potential.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005900/extras/262a35b0279c07365202a2059c63c182.avif?t=1733644404\" width=600 height=262 /></span><br><br>Build, connect, and transform your city one tile at a time in <strong>Trams, Trains and Monorails</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a meticulous planner or a spontaneous builder, every tile placement brings a new challenge and endless possibilities. Dive into the captivating world of urban planning and transportation management today!",
    "short_description": "Trams, Trains &amp; Monorails is a strategic Hex tile puzzle game. Guide the development of your own city, connecting stations and districts and completing the mini goals. Watch your city come alive as it develops industries, tourism and lost motorists.",
